---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Decision Replay" description="Predict development decisions, inspect evidence and compare your reasoning.">
  <PageHero compact eyebrow="Decision Replay · about 10 minutes" title="What would you do next?" subtitle="Try a working prototype, then navigate three staged decisions about improving it." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content">
      <h2>First, try the result</h2>
      <p>Pocket Garden is a real working example created for the Dojo with AI assistance. The decisions below are a fictional learning scenario, not a recording of how it was built.</p>
      <iframe title="Pocket Garden working example" src="/examples/pocket-garden.html" loading="lazy" sandbox="allow-scripts"></iframe>
      <div class="decisions">
        <article><span>01 / Understand</span><h3>A learner wants a reading list instead. What would you clarify first?</h3><p>Think about the audience, what the buttons should do, and how you would recognize success.</p><details><summary>Reveal one useful approach</summary><p>Agree on the desired result and a few checks: which books appear, what each control changes, and how the page should work on a phone. Ask when the brief leaves something important unclear.</p></details></article>
        <article><span>02 / Verify</span><h3>The assistant says the filters work. What evidence would you seek?</h3><p>Pick actions you could actually perform against the result.</p><details><summary>Reveal one useful approach</summary><p>Try every filter, check the cards shown, and use the keyboard if available. A claim in a chat is not the same as observing the behavior. Record anything that fails.</p></details></article>
        <article><span>03 / Adapt</span><h3>The learner cannot run JavaScript. What changes?</h3><p>Choose a fallback that keeps the content useful.</p><details><summary>Reveal one useful approach</summary><p>Make sure the content remains readable and explain which controls need JavaScript. Ask the assistant to provide a usable fallback and then test it with scripts disabled.</p></details></article>
      </div>
      <p><a href="/katas/first-prototype">Build and check your own prototype</a> · <a href="/katas/constraint-roulette">Try an unfamiliar challenge</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .content { max-width: 70rem; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 28rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: #fff; }
  .decisions { display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); margin-block: var(--space-5); }
  article { padding: var(--space-4); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--paper-raised); }
  article span { color: var(--rust-text); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 800; }
  summary { font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
